---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProfileCard from '../components/ProfileCard.astro';

const interests = [
  'Mobile wireless networks',
  'Clustering protocols',
  'QoS routing & multicast routing',
  'Network-layer security',
  'Machine learning & federated learning applications',
];
---

<Base title="Home">
  <ProfileCard />

  <section class="section">
    <p>
      I am a postdoctoral researcher at the AI Security Convergence Lab, Hankyong National University,
      South Korea, with a background in wireless communications. My work focuses on mobile wireless
      networks, clustering, QoS-aware and multicast routing, network-layer security, and the application
      of machine learning to communication systems. I also have experience lecturing and teaching
      artificial-intelligence-related courses.
    </p>
    <p>
      I hold a Ph.D. in Software and Communications Engineering from Hongik University, an M.Eng. in
      Electrical Engineering and a B.A.Sc. in Informatics Engineering, both from Politeknik Negeri Malang,
      Indonesia. Prior to my doctoral studies, I served as a Lecturer in the Department of Electrical
      Engineering at Politeknik Negeri Malang (2019–2022).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Research Interests</h2>
    <ul>
      {interests.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Collaboration</h2>
    <p>
      I welcome opportunities to collaborate on research in wireless communications, routing protocols,
      and applied machine learning. Feel free to reach out via email if you'd like to discuss a potential
      project.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
